1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
꽃향기만 남기고 갔단다
kkot-hyang-gi-man nam-gi-go gat-dan-da
Leaving behind only the scent of a flower

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
나풀나풀 날아가
na-pul-na-pul nal-a-ga
Fluttering away gently

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:18,000
빨갛게 피어난 꽃처럼
kkal-gat-ge pi-eo-nan kkot-cheo-reom
Like a blooming red flower

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:25,000
바람을 따라 은은하게
ba-ram-eul tta-ra eun-eun-ha-ge
Softly following the wind
